<title>BRAZIL: TABLE-Excel posts H1 net vs loss yr ago.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Excel posts H1 net vs loss yr ago.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private Brazilian bank Banco Excel Economico SA released the following consolidated first-half 1997 financial results.</p>
<p>		    Jan-June 1997	   Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>Net profit	  10.467 million	loss 4.99 million</p>
<p>Shr profit	   5.78 reais	   loss 2.88 reais</p>
<p>Fin Revs	   559.7 million	     270.5 million</p>
<p>Oper Profit	  8.745 million	loss 1.742 million</p>
<p>Net Worth	  584.5 million	     509.4 million</p>
<p>Note: Figures are in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>In a published statement, the bank said its net worth rose 14.7 percent in the period.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
</text>
